:[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0059","name":"许靖","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"sunshi-e-o028c-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-5f6ab83e97199a3cab55","layer":"original","quote":"渡江转斗，所向皆破，莫敢当其锋；而军令整肃，百姓怀之〖7〗。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":97,"end":127},{"id":"wudi-e-o027a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-801458e689b5a09ff186","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，孙策受袁术使渡江〖13〗，数年间遂有江东〖14〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28},{"id":"wudi-q-b-5e63888ed5d8c41275f1","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5e63888ed5d8c41275f1","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：初平四年（公元 193）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c3dba248d94a4751844d","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o024","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c2e697c9981c6cd8d3e8","layer":"original","quote":"四年春〖1〗，军鄄城〖2〗。荆州牧刘表断术粮道〖3〗。术引军入陈留，屯封丘〖4〗；黑山余贼及于夫罗等佐之。术使将刘详屯匡亭〖5〗。太祖击详，术救之；与战，大破之。术退保封丘，遂围之；未合，术走襄邑〖6〗。追到太寿〖7〗，决渠水灌城；走宁陵〖8〗。又追之，走九江〖9〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134},{"id":"xumisun-q-25a7649465ae808614a4","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-a60fbb6af86a11617afe","layer":"original","quote":"孙策东渡江，皆走交州以避其难","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o003a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-31b40d63d1cd4e25427e","layer":"original","quote":"会策将东渡，到历阳；驰书报瑜，瑜将兵迎策。策大喜曰：“吾得卿，谐也〖7〗！","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":37}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
